{"strongs": "H3000", "word": "יְבֶרֶכְיָ֫הוּ", "translit": "ye.ve.rekh.ya.hu", "root": "ברז", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Yah blesseth", "definition": "יְבֶרֶכְיָ֫הוּ proper name, masculine (= יְבָרֶכְיָהוּ s. Yah blesseth Ges «GKC:27»§ 27 , 3) father of a Zechariah in Isaiah's time Isa 8:2 usually in abbreviated form as following: בֶּרֶכְיָה 1. son of Zerubbabel 1Chr 3:20 . 2. a Levite gruard of the ark 1Chr 9:16 ; 1Chr 15:23 . 3. father of Meshullam, one of Nehemian's chiefs Neh 3:4 ; Neh 3:30 ; Neh 6:18 . 4. father of the prophet Zechariah Zech 1:1 = בֶּרֶכְיָהוּ v Zech 1:7 בֶּרֶכְיָהוּ also 5. father of Asaph 1Chr 6:24 ; 1Chr 15:17 . 6. Ephraimite chief 2Chr 28:12 . בֶּרֶכְיָה , בֶּרֶכְיָהוּ see יְבֶרֶכְיָהוּ above.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1337')\">BDB1337</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3000')\">H3000</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1336')\">BDB1336</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1338')\">BDB1338</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יְבֶרֶכְיָ֫הוּ</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (= <bdbheb>יְבָרֶכְיָהוּ</bdbheb> s. <highlight>Yah blesseth</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:27»§ 27</sup>, 3) father of a Zechariah in Isaiah's time <ref ref=\"Isa 8:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,2)\">Isa 8:2</ref> usually in abbreviated form as following: <bdbheb>בֶּרֶכְיָה</bdbheb> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> son of Zerubbabel <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:20\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,20)\">1Chr 3:20</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> a Levite gruard of the ark <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:16\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,16)\">1Chr 9:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:23\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,23)\">1Chr 15:23</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> father of Meshullam, one of Nehemian's chiefs <ref ref=\"Neh 3:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,4)\">Neh 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 3:30\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,30)\">Neh 3:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 6:18\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(16,6,18)\">Neh 6:18</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> father of the prophet Zechariah <ref ref=\"Zech 1:1\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(38,1,1)\">Zech 1:1</ref> = <bdbheb>בֶּרֶכְיָהוּ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Zech 1:7\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(38,1,7)\">Zech 1:7</ref> <bdbheb>בֶּרֶכְיָהוּ</bdbheb> also </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> father of Asaph <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:24\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,24)\">1Chr 6:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,17)\">1Chr 15:17</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> Ephraimite chief <ref ref=\"2Chr 28:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,28,12)\">2Chr 28:12</ref>. </p></div><hr><p><bdbheb>בֶּרֶכְיָה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>בֶּרֶכְיָהוּ</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>יְבֶרֶכְיָהוּ</reflink></bdbheb> above.</p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 8:2", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 8, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "1Chr 3:20", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 3, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "1Chr 9:16", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "1Chr 15:23", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 15, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Neh 3:4", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 3, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Neh 3:30", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 3, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "Neh 6:18", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 6, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Zech 1:1", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 1, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Zech 1:7", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 1, "